  "thag1.104:1.1": "4 lahuko vata me kāyo ",
  "thag1.104:1.2": "phuṭṭho ca pītisukhena vipulena ",
  "thag1.104:1.3": "tulamiva eritaṃ mālutena ",
  "thag1.104:1.4": "pilavativa me kāyoti. ",
  "thag1.104:1.5": "khitako thero. "
